	•	Section 2 Comments/Quotes: Of 510 double-lung transplant recipients, 477 met the inclusion criteria; 83 developed PGD3-T72 and 394 did not. Age was reported as median and interquartile range rather than an overall mean, and an overall female percentage was not explicitly stated. Clinical variables included primary lung disease, BMI, pulmonary hypertension, diabetes, prior thoracic surgery, waiting-list and ICU status, mechanical ventilation, vasopressors, laboratory values, Lung Allocation Score, donor characteristics, ECMO, and sequential intraoperative measurements.

