	•	Hyperparameter Tuning Reported: Yes
	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: XGBoost was compared with a baseline logistic-regression model. Models were developed at nine chronological stages using recipient, donor, and intraoperative variables. Hyperparameters were optimized through three-stage grid search with five-fold cross-validation. Automated feature selection used XGBoost Gain rankings and recursive addition of the highest-ranked predictors across 500 random train/test splits. SHAP dependence plots and a simplified logistic-regression score were used for interpretation.

